'''Zachary Christian Jaghab''' (January 17, 1997 – August 20, 2026), known professionally as '''Christian Styles''', was an American [[pornographic film actor]] and online content creator known for his work in [[gay pornography]].<ref name="Out">{{cite magazine |last=Messman-Rucker |first=Ariel |title=Gay adult performer Christian Styles dies at 29 |url=https://www.out.com/celebs/christian-styles-dies |magazine=Out |date=August 24, 2026 |access-date=August 25, 2026}}</ref><ref name="PinkNews">{{cite news |last=Hutt-Dixon |first=Tom |title=Gay adult performer Christian Styles dies aged 29 |url=https://www.thepinknews.com/2026/08/24/gay-content-creator-christian-styles-dies/ |work=PinkNews |date=August 24, 2026 |access-date=August 25, 2026}}</ref> Active in adult entertainment from 2021 until 2026, he developed an online audience of more than one million followers across Instagram and X.<ref name="People">{{cite magazine |last=Chinman |first=Luke |title=Adult Film Star Christian Styles Dies at Age 29 |url=https://people.com/adult-film-star-christian-styles-dead-12066626 |magazine=People |date=August 24, 2026 |access-date=August 25, 2026}}</ref><ref name="TMZ">{{cite web |author=TMZ Staff |title=Porn Star Christian Styles Dead at 29 |url=https://www.tmz.com/2026/08/24/christian-styles-dead/ |website=TMZ |date=August 24, 2026 |access-date=August 25, 2026}}</ref> In 2023, Styles and fellow performer Chris Damned won a fan-voted [[GayVN Awards|GayVN Award]] for Favorite All-Male Creator Collab.<ref name="AVN">{{cite web |author=AVN Staff |title=2023 GayVN Award Winners Announced |url=https://avn.com/news/gay/2023-gayvn-award-winners-announced-174550 |website=AVN |date=January 6, 2023 |access-date=August 25, 2026}}</ref>

== Early life ==
Styles was born on January 17, 1997, and was raised in [[Canton, Michigan]].<ref name="Obituary">{{cite web |title=Zachary Christian Jaghab |url=https://www.stanleyturowskifuneralhome.com/obituaries/zachary-jaghab |website=Stanley Turowski Funeral Home |access-date=August 25, 2026}}</ref><ref name="People" /><ref name="PrideSource">{{cite news |last=Bricker Hunt |first=Sarah |title=Christian Styles, Metro Detroit Adult Performer, Dies at 29 |url=https://pridesource.com/article/christian-styles |work=Pride Source |date=August 24, 2026 |access-date=August 25, 2026}}</ref> He is the son of Johnny and Ellen Jaghab.<ref>{{cite news |last1=Nelson |first1=Elise |title=Adult Film Star Christian Styles’ Cause of Death Revealed After Shocking Death at 29: Details |url=https://www.usmagazine.com/celebrity-news/news/adult-film-star-christian-styles-cause-of-death-revealed/ |access-date=28 September 2026 |work=Us Weekly |date=15 September 2026}}</ref> His family is of [[Middle Eastern]] origin, and he grew up in an [[Arab Americans|Arab-American]] family connected to the [[Antiochian Orthodox]] Christian community in Michigan.{{cn|date=September 2026}}

Styles graduated from [[Plymouth–Canton Educational Park]] in 2015.{{cn|date=September 2026}}

== Career ==

