'''Samantha Nicole Doucette''' (born July 25, 1993) is an American basketball coach and former player who is currently the head coach of the [[California State University, Fullerton]] [[Cal State Fullerton Titans women's basketball|women's basketball team]].<ref name ="CSUF release">{{cite web |title=Sammy Doucette Named Head Women's Basketball Coach |url=https://fullertontitans.com/news/2026/5/4/sammy-doucette-named-head-womens-basketball-coach.aspx |website=Cal State Fullerton Athletics |access-date=14 September 2026}}</ref>

== Coaching career ==
Doucette played college basketball at [[Vanguard University]] before turning to coaching, beginning as a graduate assistant at [[Concordia University Irvine]] and as an assistant at [[Hope International University]]. Doucette coached high school basketball at [[Costa Mesa Middle and High School|Costa Mesa High School]] for a season before she was hired to be the head coach at [[Orange Coast College]].<ref>{{cite web |last1=Turner |first1=Andrew |title= Orange Coast College hires Samantha Doucette as women's basketball coach |url=https://www.latimes.com/socal/daily-pilot/sports/tn-dpt-sp-cm-orange-coast-samantha-doucette-basketball-20190621-story.html |website=Los Angeles Times |publisher=Daily Pilot |access-date=14 September 2026}}</ref> At Orange Coast, Doucette was credited with rebuilding a program that had won two games and had two returning players into a program that won two [[California Community College Athletic Association]] (CCCAA) championships and was considered a consistent CCCAA playoff contender.<ref>{{cite web |last1=Bibona |first1=Chris |title=Young and gunnin’: Sammy Doucette’s revitalization of OCC women’s basketball |url=https://www.coastreportonline.com/sports/article_94406e7a-a34c-11ec-9835-bbd7dbda4e7c.html |website=Coast Report |access-date=14 September 2026}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last1=Hessen |first1=Timothy |title=A meteoric rise to the top |url=https://www.coastreportonline.com/sports/article_a5ec8676-b472-11ed-86d0-77928ec29371.html |website=Coast Report |access-date=14 September 2026}}</ref>

Doucette was named the head coach at [[Cal State Fullerton Titans women's basketball|Cal State Fullerton]] on May 4, 2026.<ref name="CSUF release"/><ref>{{cite web |last1=Gonzalez |first1=Sergio |title=CSUF women's basketball announces Sammy Doucette as new head coach |url=https://dailytitan.com/sports/csuf-womens-basketball-announces-sammy-doucette-as-new-head-coach/article_46f5cf44-b34f-4340-aa33-de1eb4bc274c.html |website=The Daily Titan |access-date=14 September 2026}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last1=Mendez-Yapkowitz |first1=David |title=Minyon Moore, Sammy Doucette ready to lead in the Big West |url=https://www.theixsports.com/the-ix-basketball-newsroom/ncaa-basketball/minyon-moore-sammy-doucette-ready-to-lead-in-the-big-west/ |website=The IX Sports |access-date=14 September 2026}}</ref>

